@startuml domain-model
' Refined domain model (CA2) - Scenario 29 Local Podcast Production Service
' Changes from CA1: RD-04 (Draft status values, Blocked derived),
'                   RD-07 (DraftReview is for PublicationChannel),
'                   RD-12 (Draft.versionNumber)
title Refined Domain Model - Production Record System (CA2)

hide circle
hide methods
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam linetype ortho

class PartnerOrganisation {
  name
}

class Proposal {
  subject
  intendedAudience
  format
  expectedDuration
  preferredPublicationPeriod
  programmeType
  proposedBy
}

class ProposalDecision {
  outcome
  decisionDate
  conditions
  note
  decidedBy
}

class Episode {
  title
  description
}

class Contributor {
  name
  contactPreference
  availability
}

class Contribution {
  role
  agreedCredit
}

class Consent {
  form
  intendedUse
  dateGiven
}

class RecordingSession {
  date
  locationType
  locationDescription
  equipmentNeeded
}

class SourceRecording {
  workingName
  usabilityNote
}

class Draft {
  versionNumber
  versionDescription
  status
}

class Permission {
  materialDescription
  materialSource
  permittedUse
  status
}

class DraftReview {
  outcome
  reviewDate
  reviewedBy
  comments
}

class Publication {
  scheduledDate
  actualDate
  status
}

class PublicationDateChange {
  earlierDate
  newDate
  reason
  changeDate
}

class PublicationChannel {
  name
}

class Correction {
  type
  reason
  correctionDate
}

PartnerOrganisation "0..1" -- "0..*" Proposal : proposes >
Proposal "1" -- "1..*" Episode : plans >
Proposal "1" -- "0..*" ProposalDecision : receives >
Proposal "0..*" -- "0..*" Contributor : names as proposed >

Contributor "1" -- "0..*" Contribution : makes >
Episode "1" -- "0..*" Contribution : involves >
Contribution "1" -- "0..*" Consent : is covered by >

Episode "1" -- "0..*" RecordingSession : is recorded in >
RecordingSession "1" -- "0..*" SourceRecording : produces >
Episode "1" -- "0..*" Draft : is edited into >
Draft "0..*" -- "1..*" SourceRecording : draws on >

Permission "0..*" -- "1..*" Draft : is needed by >
Draft "1" -- "0..*" DraftReview : is reviewed in >
DraftReview "0..*" -- "1" PublicationChannel : is for >

Draft "1" -- "0..*" Publication : is released as >
PublicationChannel "1" -- "0..*" Publication : carries >

Publication "1" -- "0..*" PublicationDateChange : records >
Publication "1" -- "0..*" Correction : is amended by >
Correction "0..1" -- "0..1" Draft : introduces replacement >

note bottom of Draft
  status: awaiting review | returned for changes |
  postponed | withdrawn | approved (RD-04).
  "Approved version" is a status, not a class (A11).
  Blocked and ready to be scheduled are derived,
  not stored (BR5, RD-04).
  versionNumber is sequential per episode (RD-12).
end note

note right of DraftReview
  Approval applies per channel (A9, RD-07).
end note

note bottom of Correction
  A replacement Draft is reviewed through
  UC8 before publication (A14, Q6 open).
end note
@enduml
